  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1101.01 “Applicant” means a person requesting authorization to issue citations for a violation of fire safety or applicable licensing rules.\n\nSource. #4225, eff 02-10-87, EXPIRED 2-10-93\n\nNew. #5951, eff 1-24-95, EXPIRED: 1-24-03\n\nNew. #7832, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 2-22-11\n\nNew. #10011, eff 10-19-11; ss by #10137, eff 5-23-12, EXPIRED: 5-23-22\n\nNew. #13418, eff 7-25-22",
